  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Migrant Protection in selected Silk Route countries (PROTECT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposed Action aims at improving migration management covering all phases of (in &amp;amp; out) migration in the target countries, enhancing awareness on the risks of irregular migration and facilitate the protection of migrants.&amp;nbsp;It will provide support to informed migration decisions at the individual, family, and community level, covering all phases of (in and out) migration, including pre-departure preparation, migration and residence/work abroad, and sustainable reintegration. &amp;nbsp;The Action will support the respective governments in their efforts to regulate labour migration and return, fight against and prevent irregular migration, smuggling of migrants (SOM), trafficking in persons (TIP), mitigate the negative consequences of migration and facilitate its positive impact. Depending on the needs and priorities of each target country, this Action will support migrants along the migration cycle, including in- and out- migration and return, through the provision of accurate information on legal pathways, the dangers of irregular migration and support programmes in country.</narrative>
  </description>
